Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:06.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}Contraction replaces A and B by one current cluster while retaining both original members.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:06.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}收缩操作将 A 和 B 替换为一个当前簇，同时保留两个原始成员。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.14,0:00:11.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}The new connection to C combines the old A to C and B to C edges.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.14,0:00:11.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}新簇与 C 的连接需要合并原来的 A 到 C、B 到 C 两条边。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.07,0:00:15.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}Their weights are one and four, giving affinity five.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.07,0:00:15.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}两条边的权重分别为一和四，因此亲和度为五。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.11,0:00:20.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}Do not keep only the largest edge, and do not reuse a stale candidate ranking.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.11,0:00:20.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}不能只保留最大的那条边，也不能继续使用过时的候选排序。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.45,0:00:26.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}The next choice must use these updated affinities and the updated cluster sizes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.45,0:00:26.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}下一次选择必须使用更新后的亲和度与簇大小。
